    },
    "message": "Move resource_service_v1 and the service's arbitrate, complete and request to Rust\n\nRust owns the namespace with typed rows and a tick's check. One pass of arbitrate's loop after the\npositions, complete, request and record_request_outcome are one kernel each, which plan and then\nwrite. An empty queue needs no pass at all. An independent FIFO stays in Python.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
