    },
    "message": "Move the trip actions, routes and trips to Rust\n\nfetch_water, collect_meal and request_toilet plan the choice of a facility, its route and its trip\nin one kernel. _route and _schedule_travel are kernels for every caller, and a trip's identity no\nlonger reads the pending events. A trip that takes no time, edge capacities and another route\npolicy stay in Python.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
